MOTION["P-03a"] = "From the side at knee height, her right hand hauls the short brace's top strap up over the kneecap in one pull, holds a moment, and the brace sags back down below the kneecap as the hand eases; her left hand stays on the chair seat; she stays seated, nobody speaks; the chair, the slippers and the kitchen behind stay exactly as in the frame. Stylized 3D animation, exactly on model from the frame, the brace rigid in shape. No camera travel; nobody else; no cut; the brace never changes design."
