MOTION["P-01a_v4"] = "From the hall floor looking up the flight, she backs away from the landing: she retreats one step toward the lens, her right heel feeling for the step beneath her and settling there, her weight sinking onto it, the left foot joining it — she sinks lower in the frame and grows larger, her head dropping below the window, the landing above her staying empty; both hands slide down the rail with her, her back to the lens, her face to the landing; nobody speaks. Stylized 3D animation, exactly on model from the frame. No camera travel; nobody else; no cut; she never climbs, never steps onto the landing."
MOTION["P-01a_v5"] = "From the hall floor looking up the flight, she backs away from the landing slowly, one step at a time: her right heel feels for the step directly below the one it leaves and settles on it, her weight sinks onto it, the left foot joins it on that same step, and only then the next step begins — two slow steps in the whole clip, about two seconds each, every step taken in turn, each foot stopping at the next step; she sinks lower in the frame and grows larger, the landing above her staying empty, both hands sliding down the rail, her back to the lens, her face to the landing; nobody speaks. Stylized 3D animation, exactly on model from the frame. No camera travel; nobody else; no cut; she never climbs, never skips a step."
MOTION["P-01a"] = "From the hall floor looking up the flight, she takes exactly one slow step down backwards: her right foot lowers onto the step just below and takes her weight, the left foot joins it on that same step, and she holds there, both hands on the rail, her back to the lens, her face to the landing; nobody speaks. Stylized 3D animation, exactly on model from the frame, the staircase exactly as in the frame. No camera travel; nobody else; no cut; never a second step."
